  "description": "<p>Range <strong>120ft</strong>; <strong>5ft radius</strong> per level (max <strong>100ft</strong>); <strong>1 round</strong>.</p><ul><li>Creatures standing on the ground fall <strong>Prone</strong> and cannot cast spells that round; <strong>Reflex negates</strong>.</li><li>Each structure takes <strong>20d6</strong> damage and collapses at <strong>0 HP</strong> or below, dealing <strong>8d6</strong> bludgeoning to occupants (<strong>Reflex halves</strong>).</li><li>One fissure per five levels opens (<strong>10ft</strong> wide, <strong>30ft</strong> deep); creatures on it fall in and take <strong>3d6</strong> damage; <strong>Reflex negates</strong>.</li><li>Flying creatures are unaffected.</li></ul><p class=\"arn-note\"><strong>Classes:</strong> Cleric, Druid</p>",
